   "官方伤害数字": "Official Damage Numbers",
   "只显示达到官方暴击条件的红色数字。关闭时仍显示每一次命中。": "Show only red numbers that meet the official crit rule. While off, every hit still shows a number.",
   "弹药数量": "Ammo Count",
+  "官方特效": "Official Effects",
+  "关": "Off",
+  "精简": "Lite",
+  "完整": "Full",
+  "使用服主从自己的游戏客户端提取的官方战斗特效（普攻、弹道、命中、状态、阵亡、部署，干员、召唤物和敌人的技能与天赋，以及秘术师储存的能量），连到这台服务器的玩家看到的都是服主提取的这一份；提取里没有的或对战中没有时机的（如只在游戏内部条件下触发的天赋效果）仍为本作的特效。精简：半分辨率贴图、粒子减半，适合手机。只在 3D 棋盘上显示。": "Uses the official battle effects the server owner extracted from their own game client (normal attacks, projectiles, hits, statuses, deaths, deployments, the skills and talents of operators, summons and enemies, and a Mystic Caster's stored energy); every player on this server sees the owner's extraction. What it does not cover, or what the battle gives no moment for (such as talent effects that only internal game conditions trigger), stays this game's own. Lite: half-resolution textures and half the particles, suited to phones. Shown on the 3D board only.",
   "弹药类技能开启时，在弹药条下方显示剩余弹药 / 总弹药数（如 13/14）。官方界面没有这个数字。": "While an ammo skill runs, shows the rounds left / in total under its ammo bar (e.g. 13/14). The official interface has no such number.",
   "画面质量": "Graphics Quality",
   "触屏操作：点击单位选中（撤退 / 出售）· 长按单位或卡牌查看详情 · 拖动部署后滑动选择朝向": "Touch controls: tap a unit to select it (Retreat / Sell) · long-press a unit or card for details · after dragging to deploy, swipe to choose a direction",
