+  "打开后，对局左下角可以查看自己干员的伤害、治疗和 DPS / HPS。官方界面没有这个窗口。改变玩法的插件对局在 Worker 里演算，统计不到，按钮不显示。": "When on, the bottom-left of a match shows your operators' damage, healing and DPS / HPS. The official interface has no such panel. A match whose plugins change the rules is simulated in a Worker and is not counted, so the button stays hidden.",
