+  "导入需要 HTTPS 或 localhost。": "Import needs HTTPS or localhost.",
+  "从素材包 zip、完整包 zip 或自己的 public/assets 文件夹导入。只收下和服务器清单哈希一致的文件，不上传任何内容。": "Import from an asset-pack zip, a full-pack zip or your own public/assets folder. Only files whose hash matches the server manifest are kept. Nothing is uploaded.",
+  "导入只从服务器读取素材清单，美术文件不走网络；没有导入的素材仍在用到时从服务器加载。": "Import reads only the asset lists from the server; the art files never cross the network. Art you have not imported still loads from the server when it is needed.",
+  "秘术师能量": "Mystic Energy",
+  "在秘术师的血条下方显示储存的攻击能量 / 上限（如 2/3）。官方用干员身上的特效表示，没有这个数字。": "Shows a Mystic Caster's stored attack energy / its maximum under the HP bar (e.g. 2/3). The official game shows it as an effect on the operator, without a number.",
+  "全选": "Select all",
+  "清除选择": "Clear selection",
+  "删除所选（{n}）": "Delete selected ({n})",
+  "删除所选插件": "Delete the selected plugins",
+  "下面 {n} 个插件会移到 plugins/_removed/ 文件夹，不会被彻底删除：": "These plugins ({n}) move to the plugins/_removed/ folder and are not deleted for good:",
+  "想恢复的话，把它的文件夹从 plugins/_removed/ 移回 plugins/，并把文件夹名改回插件 id（去掉后面的时间）。": "To restore one, move its folder from plugins/_removed/ back into plugins/ and rename it to the plugin id (drop the time at the end).",
+  "{n} 个插件没有删除": "{n} {n|plugin was|plugins were} not deleted",
+  "其余 {n} 个已移到 plugins/_removed/。": "The other {n} {n|was|were} moved to plugins/_removed/.",
+  "已移到 plugins/_removed/：{n} 个插件": "Moved to plugins/_removed/: {n} {n|plugin|plugins}",
